ModelBlaster: softmax_s8 `pext_int_memo2` -- pext_int_memo with its multiplies priced for Rocket.

iiswc-tutorial ROCC_DECOUPLED.md section 8.14 (T1 lever 1, refined after pext_int_memo measured
101.7 cycles/element on the board against an estimate of 30).  The curated kernel is
fpga/pynq-z2/modelblaster/kernels/pext_nl/pext_nl_softmax_s8_pext_int_memo2.c.  Registered after
pext_int_memo, so no existing build changes its pick; scripts/50's *_smx2 variants select it.

Applies on top of patches/0009, 0060, 0100, 0102, 0104 and 0105.
--- a/pipeline/reference_kernels.py
+++ b/pipeline/reference_kernels.py
